    <briefdescription>
<para>Store an acceleration and mass flow rate profile of a spacecraft maneuver. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Represents a spacecraft maneuver defined by a time-ordered array of states containing position, velocity, acceleration, and mass flow rate, and the interpolation type used to evaluate its acceleration and mass flow rate profiles between those states. Provides methods to compute delta-V, delta-mass, average thrust, average specific impulse, and to convert to tabulated dynamics. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
